    "detailed_description": "An action/adventure game taking ques from both film-noir and samurai-drama's of old, &quot;samurai_jazz&quot; takes players on an adventure through an enigmatic city, engaging in  sword-fights, encounters with mythological beings, and quirky dialog with the local inhabitants presented with a pseudo 8-bit style. While action remains the central focus, a bit of detective work and puzzle-solving will become necessary while adventuring in this pixelated nightmare. <br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Do battle with enemy swordsmen and demons<br></li><li>Adventure through an enigmatic city and interact with it's citizens<br></li><li>Presented with 8-bit graphics and electro-jazz soundtrack<br></li><li>Supports Xbox 360 Controller</li></ul>",
